# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AI SEO Growth Dashboard – Environment Variables
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your real values.
# NEVER commit `.env` to version control.
#
# How to use:
#   Option A (recommended): use python-dotenv
#     pip install python-dotenv
#     Add `from dotenv import load_dotenv; load_dotenv()` at the top of app.py
#
#   Option B: export in your shell before starting Flask
#     export GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...
#     python app.py

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Groq – used for AI recommendations in the Website Audit feature
# Get your key at https://console.groq.com
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_your_groq_api_key_here

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# (Optional / Future) Keyword Metrics Provider
# Connect one of these to enable real Volume, KD, and CPC data.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# DataForSEO REST API
# DATAFORSEO_LOGIN=
# DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD=

# Semrush API
# SEMRUSH_API_KEY=

# Google Keyword Planner (requires a Google Ads account)
# GOOGLE_ADS_DEVELOPER_TOKEN=
# GOOGLE_ADS_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_ADS_CLIENT_SECRET=
# GOOGLE_ADS_REFRESH_TOKEN=
# GOOGLE_ADS_CUSTOMER_ID=
